>\n      \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__h2 org-liquid-page__h2--light\">项目展示\u003C\u002Fdiv>\n      \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-toolbar\">\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-search-wrap\">\n          \u003Csvg class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-search-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\u002F\u002Fwww.w3.org\u002F2000\u002Fsvg\">\n            \u003Cpath d=\"M11.742 10.344a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-1.397 1.398h-.001c.03.04.062.078.098.115l3.85 3.85a1 1 0 0 0 1.415-1.414l-3.85-3.85a1.007 1.007 0 0 0-.115-.1zM12 6.5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-11 0 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0z\" fill=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)\">\u003C\u002Fpath>\n          \u003C\u002Fsvg>\n          \u003Cinput type=\"search\" name=\"org_liquid_repo_search\" class=\"org-liquid-repo-search org-liquid-page__repo-search\" placeholder=\"搜索项目\" autocomplete=\"off\" \u002F>\n        \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-select\" data-org-liquid-custom-select aria-label=\"可见性\">\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-select-trigger\" role=\"combobox\">\n            \u003Cspan class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-select-value\">全部\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \u003Csvg class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-select-arrow\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\u002F\u002Fwww.w3.org\u002F2000\u002Fsvg\">\n              \u003Cpath d=\"M2.5 4.5L6 8L9.5 4.5\" stroke=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\u003C\u002Fpath>\n            \u003C\u002Fsvg>\n          \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n          \u003Cul class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-select-options\" role=\"listbox\">\n            \u003Cli class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-select-option org-liquid-page__repo-select-option--active\" role=\"option\" data-value=\"all\">全部\u003C\u002Fli>\n            \u003Cli class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-select-option\" role=\"option\" data-value=\"private\">私有\n            \u003C\u002Fli>\n            \u003Cli class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-select-option\" role=\"option\" data-value=\"public\">公开\n            \u003C\u002Fli>\n          \u003C\u002Ful>\n          \u003Cselect name=\"org_liquid_repo_visibility\" class=\"org-liquid-repo-visibility org-liquid-page__repo-select-native\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            \u003Coption value=\"all\">全部\u003C\u002Foption>\n            \u003Coption value=\"private\">私有\u003C\u002Foption>\n            \u003Coption value=\"public\">公开\u003C\u002Foption>\n          \u003C\u002Fselect>\n        \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-view-all\">\n          \u003Ca href=\"\u002Forg\u002Fcann\u002Frepos\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-view-all-text\">查看全部项目\u003C\u002Fa>\n          \u003Cimg class=\"org-icon-right\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Ficon_right.svg?version=1789387680082\" alt=\"\" \u002F>\n        \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n      \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n    \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n    \u003Cul class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-list reset-list\" id=\"repo-list-container\">\n      \n      \u003Cli class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-item\" data-repo-haystack=\"ge cann\u002Fge ge（graph engine）是面向昇腾的图编译器和执行器，提供了计算图优化、多流并行、内存复用和模型下沉等技术手段，加速模型执行效率，减少模型内存占用。 ge 提供对 pytorch、tensorflow 前端的友好接入能力，并同时支持 onnx、pb 等主流模型格式的解析与编译。\" data-repo-visibility=\"public\">\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-main\">\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-name-row\">\n            \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-name-wrap\">\n              \n              \u003Cimg class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-icon\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_g.png?version=1789387680082\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" data-letter=\"g\" \u002F>\n              \n              \u003Ca href=\"\u002Fcann\u002Fge\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-name\">ge\u003C\u002Fa>\n            \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n            \u003Cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-star-btn \" data-repo-id=\"8824148\">\n              \u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\u002F\u002Fwww.w3.org\u002F2000\u002Fsvg\">\u003Cpath d=\"M8 1.5l1.85 3.75 4.15.6-3 2.93.71 4.12L8 10.87 4.29 12.9l.71-4.12-3-2.93 4.15-.6L8 1.5z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\">\u003C\u002Fpath>\u003C\u002Fsvg> Star\n            \u003C\u002Fbutton>\n          \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n          \u003Cp class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-desc\">GE（Graph Engine）是面向昇腾的图编译器和执行器，提供了计算图优化、多流并行、内存复用和模型下沉等技术手段，加速模型执行效率，减少模型内存占用。 GE 提供对 PyTorch、TensorFlow 前端的友好接入能力，并同时支持 onnx、pb 等主流模型格式的解析与编译。\u003C\u002Fp>\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta\">\n            \n            \u003Cspan class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-lang\">\n              \u003Cspan class=\"org-liquid-page__lang-dot\" style=\"background-color: #f34b7d\">\u003C\u002Fspan>\n              C++\n            \u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \n            \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-stat\">\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_fork_1.png?version=1789387680082\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta-icon\" \u002F>\n              \u003Cspan>487\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n            \u003Ca href=\"\u002Fcann\u002Fge\u002Fpulls\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-stat\">\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_merge_1.png?version=1789387680082\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta-icon\" \u002F>\n              \u003Cspan>121\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \u003C\u002Fa>\n            \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-stat org-liquid-page__repo-stat-last\">\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_star.svg?version=1789387680082\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta-icon\" \u002F>\n              \u003Cspan>759\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n            \n            \u003Cspan class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-updated\">更新于2026-09-27\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \n          \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n        \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n      \u003C\u002Fli>\n      \n      \u003Cli class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-item\" data-repo-haystack=\"runtime cann\u002Fruntime 本项目提供cann运行时组件和维测功能组件。\" data-repo-visibility=\"public\">\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-main\">\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-name-row\">\n            \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-name-wrap\">\n              \n              \u003Cimg class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-icon\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_r.png?version=1789387680082\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" data-letter=\"r\" \u002F>\n              \n              \u003Ca href=\"\u002Fcann\u002Fruntime\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-name\">runtime\u003C\u002Fa>\n            \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n            \u003Cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-star-btn \" data-repo-id=\"8810053\">\n              \u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\u002F\u002Fwww.w3.org\u002F2000\u002Fsvg\">\u003Cpath d=\"M8 1.5l1.85 3.75 4.15.6-3 2.93.71 4.12L8 10.87 4.29 12.9l.71-4.12-3-2.93 4.15-.6L8 1.5z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\">\u003C\u002Fpath>\u003C\u002Fsvg> Star\n            \u003C\u002Fbutton>\n          \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n          \u003Cp class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-desc\">本项目提供CANN运行时组件和维测功能组件。\u003C\u002Fp>\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta\">\n            \n            \u003Cspan class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-lang\">\n              \u003Cspan class=\"org-liquid-page__lang-dot\" style=\"background-color: #005daa\">\u003C\u002Fspan>\n              Motorola 68K Assembly\n            \u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \n            \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-stat\">\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_fork_1.png?version=1789387680082\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta-icon\" \u002F>\n              \u003Cspan>810\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n            \u003Ca href=\"\u002Fcann\u002Fruntime\u002Fpulls\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-stat\">\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_merge_1.png?version=1789387680082\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta-icon\" \u002F>\n              \u003Cspan>175\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \u003C\u002Fa>\n            \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-stat org-liquid-page__repo-stat-last\">\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_star.svg?version=1789387680082\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta-icon\" \u002F>\n              \u003Cspan>650\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n            \n            \u003Cspan class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-updated\">更新于2026-09-27\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \n          \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n        \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n      \u003C\u002Fli>\n      \n      \u003Cli class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-item\" data-repo-haystack=\"driver cann\u002Fdriver 本项目是cann提供的驱动模块，实现基础驱动和资源管理及调度等功能，使能昇腾芯片。\" data-repo-visibility=\"public\">\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-main\">\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-name-row\">\n            \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-name-wrap\">\n              \n              \u003Cimg class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-icon\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_d.png?version=1789387680082\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" data-letter=\"d\" \u002F>\n              \n              \u003Ca href=\"\u002Fcann\u002Fdriver\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-name\">driver\u003C\u002Fa>\n            \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n            \u003Cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-star-btn \" data-repo-id=\"8795005\">\n              \u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\u002F\u002Fwww.w3.org\u002F2000\u002Fsvg\">\u003Cpath d=\"M8 1.5l1.85 3.75 4.15.6-3 2.93.71 4.12L8 10.87 4.29 12.9l.71-4.12-3-2.93 4.15-.6L8 1.5z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\">\u003C\u002Fpath>\u003C\u002Fsvg> Star\n            \u003C\u002Fbutton>\n          \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n          \u003Cp class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-desc\">本项目是CANN提供的驱动模块，实现基础驱动和资源管理及调度等功能，使能昇腾芯片。\u003C\u002Fp>\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta\">\n            \n            \u003Cspan class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-lang\">\n              \u003Cspan class=\"org-liquid-page__lang-dot\" style=\"background-color: #555555\">\u003C\u002Fspan>\n              C\n            \u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \n            \u003Cdiv class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-stat\">\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_fork_1.png?version=1789387680082\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-meta-icon\" \u002F>\n              \u003Cspan>149\u003C\u002Fspan>\n            \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n            \u003Ca href=\"\u002Fcann\u002Fdriver\u002Fpulls\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"org-liquid-page__repo-stat\">\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcdn-img.gitcode.com\u002Fcustom-homepage\u002F5162848\u002Fimages\u002Frepo_merge_1.png?version=1789387680082\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"org-liquid-page_