esc\">\n            打卡成长任务获取CANN专属积分，\u003Cbr \u002F>\n            兑换CANNLab算力卡时\n          \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n          \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitcode.com\u002Fsetting\u002Fpoints?task=cann&amp;type=shop&amp;tid=cann\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"org-live-card__btn\">兑换算力\u003C\u002Fa>\n        \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n      \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n      \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-carousel__slide\" data-slide-index=\"4\" data-bg=\"2\">\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-card\">\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-card__title\">CANN社区任务\u003C\u002Fdiv>\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-card__desc\">\n            报名任务赢取万元丰厚奖金！\n          \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n          \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitcode.com\u002Forg\u002Fcann\u002Fdiscussions\u002F211\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"org-live-card__btn\">立即参与\u003C\u002Fa>\n        \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n      \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n      \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-carousel__slide\" data-slide-index=\"5\" data-bg=\"3\">\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-card\">\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-card__title\">CANN 算子\u003Cspan style=\"color: #E02128\">天梯赛\u003C\u002Fspan>火热进行中！\u003C\u002Fdiv>\n          \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-card__desc\">\n            长期算子性能极限打榜，单赛题月度冠军最高奖励10000\n          \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n          \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcompetition.gitcode.com\u002Fcompetition\u002F2057085957316272129\u002Fintro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"org-live-card__btn\">立即报名\u003C\u002Fa>\n        \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n      \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n      \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n    \u003C\u002Fdiv>\n\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-carousel__controls\">\n      \u003Cdiv class=\"org-live-carousel__indicators\">\n        \u003Cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"org-live-carousel__indicator org-live-carousel__indicator--active\" data-slide-to=\"0\" aria-label=\"第1张\">\u003C\u002Fbutton>\n        \u003Cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"org-live-carousel__indicator\" data-slide-to=\"1\" a