2279,"skipBindSingleLogin":2280,"welcomeDesc":2281,"welcomeDescNotCann":2282,"welcomeLegalText":2283,"welcomeTitle":2284,"welcomeTitleNotCann":2285},"一次绑定，无缝调用 NPU 算力与开发调试工具","绑定华为云账号（推荐）","前往注册并完成实名认证","还没有华为云账号？","仅本次会话生效，关闭页面或超时后需再次手动验证","暂不绑定，使用已有账号单次登录","CANNLab是为CANN社区开发者提供的开箱即用的云端开发环境，内置CANN软件、NPU算力和 WebIDE等全套开发工具，提供浏览器和本地IDE客户端双接入方式，支持基于昇腾快速创新。","基于华为云开发环境内置开发工具和NPU算力，支持编码、编译、部署、调试调优等全流程开发活动。","根据国家最新法律法规要求，使用云资源必须进行实名认证","欢迎使用一站式开发平台CANNLab","欢迎使用云开发环境",{"browser":2287,"code":2305},{"download":2288,"history":2291,"recent":2295,"star":2296,"stared":2298,"view":2302},{"hint":2289,"tab":2290},"仅展示近3个月的下载记录 . 这里会自动追踪下载项目的更新，若有更新会显示气泡提示","下载历史",{"button":2292,"desc":2293,"title":2294},"查看浏览历史","下次来「浏览历史」可以继续研究","已保存到浏览历史","最近项目",{"all":2297},"一键 Star",{"all":2299},{"empty":2300,"success":2301},"已经全部 Star 啦，去逛逛别的吧 ✨","一键 Star 完成，${num} 个项目已点亮 ⭐",{"hint":2303,"tab":2304},"仅展示近30天的浏览记录","浏览历史",{"addFile":2306,"applySuggestionSuccess":2307,"branch":2308,"clone":2312,"codeMerga":2325,"contributor":2329,"copyPath":2330,"createFromTplErrMsg":2331,"createFromTplLoading":2332,"createFromTplTitle":2333,"createRelease":2334,"defaultBranch":2335,"delFile":2336,"delFolder":2337,"domainTagRecommend":2338,"download":2344,"downloadTips":2349,"downloadUsage":2350,"extSubmitInfo":2351,"file":2352,"forkAbnormal":2359,"forkLoading":2360,"forkTip":2361,"importAbnormal":2362,"importLoading":2363,"inputMsg":2364,"languageType":2367,"newBranch":2368,"newBranchBtn":2370,"newest":2371,"newFile":2372,"notFound":2373,"ossCompass":2374,"ossCompassSunburst":2375,"publish":2377,"quickStart":2378,"release":2379,"repoIntro":1988,"searchFile":2380,"searchFileText":2382,"selectEmail":2383,"share":2384,"sourceRepo":2387,"submit":2388,"submitEmail":2393,"submitFail":2394,"submitInfo":2395,"submitSuccess":2396,"syncRepo":2397,"syncRepoText":2416,"topic":2417,"tree":2419,"uploadFile":2432,"viewAllRelease":2433,"viewBranchList":2434,"viewTagList":2435,"watch":2436},"添加文件","已成功应用{length}条代码建议",{"rule1"